#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/046/BanOmi116_04622:TEXT_BANOMI116_04622_STIGMA4_000_014:1"
msgid "In comparison, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>'s queasiness is inconsequential. Shiny objects will be provided as a distraction from current digestive distress in the interest of maintaining morale."
msgstr "По сравнению с этим тошнота у <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> несущественна. Чтобы поддержать боевой дух, мы отвлечём его блестящими предметами."
